    {
      "component_id": "c_021",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Take Generic Viagra Professional exactly as prescribed by your doctor. Do not take in larger or smaller amounts or for longer than recommended. Follow the directions on your prescription label. Generic Viagra Professional is usually taken only when needed, 30 minutes to 1 hour before sexual activity. You may take it up to 4 hours before sexual activity. Do not take Viagra more than once per day.",
